Z||000013||Cozmo||09-20-2001||09:00 AM||||Here's some pics of my recently completed hood vent...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/scoopangle.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/scoopfront.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/scoopside.jpg"> <BR>Yes, that IS a dash vent grill  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I cut the hood with a skill saw with a 24 TPI blade. Used 3M flexible epoxy to hold it all together.  I had to trim about 1-1/2" off the lip of the spare tire well.  This is a pretty easy mod to do, it's impractical to ship a hood so I don't think it would make a viable product.<BR>I didn't notice any reduction in engine temp., but the grill gets plenty hot after some spirited driving...<P>BobC ||||reg||1
